###

# MyDataController upload 테스트
POST {{mvc_webapp_HostAddress}}/api/my_service/upload
Accept: application/json
FoxRest-Authenticate: ENCYPTED__rPKMZf3XqHS/F/81x0riYTbr2nEdG8mMNWJurK/4IPw=
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=-----boundary

-------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="request"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "queryId": "products.get",
  "parameters": {
    "product_id": "PROD001"
  }
}
-------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="upload_file.txt"
Content-Type: plain/text

This is uploaded file content.
-------boundary--
